{"id":1734,"date":"2026-02-06T15:11:12","date_gmt":"2026-02-06T07:11:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/?p=1734"},"modified":"2026-02-06T15:15:14","modified_gmt":"2026-02-06T07:15:14","slug":"alumina-fiber-raising-the-performance-standard-for-next-generation-foldable-and-premium-3c-devices-2","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/alumina-fiber-raising-the-performance-standard-for-next-generation-foldable-and-premium-3c-devices-2\/","title":{"rendered":"Vulcan Shield Global at JEC World 2026: Advancing High-Temperature Alumina Fiber Solutions"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1734\" class=\"elementor elementor-1734\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f2661d3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f2661d3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75f36bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"75f36bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<header aria-label=\"Article header\"><p id=\"ember458\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">Vulcan Shield Global will be exhibiting at JEC World 2026, the world\u2019s leading international composites exhibition. The annual event will take place in Paris, bringing together companies and professionals across advanced materials, composites manufacturing, aerospace, automotive, energy, and industrial sectors.<\/p><p id=\"ember459\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">You\u2019ll be able to find us at<strong>Hall 5<\/strong><strong>Booth F114<\/strong>, where we\u2019ll be sharing our latest developments in alumina fiber technology.<\/p><\/header><p><\/p><div><h3 id=\"ember460\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">JEC World: The Global Hub for Composites and Advanced Materials<\/h3><p id=\"ember461\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">JEC World has long been one of the most important meeting points for the global composites community. Every year, engineers, OEMs, researchers, suppliers, and decision-makers gather to exchange ideas, discover new materials, and explore practical solutions to real manufacturing challenges.<\/p><p id=\"ember462\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">For Vulcan Shield Global, attending JEC World is about more than showcasing products. It\u2019s an opportunity to learn from industry conversations, understand emerging needs, and discuss how alumina fiber materials can support high-temperature and extreme-environment applications.<\/p><\/div><p><\/p><div><h3 id=\"ember463\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">Strengthening Supply in Europe<\/h3><p id=\"ember464\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">As part of our long-term commitment to the global composites ecosystem, Vulcan Shield Global is developing a<strong>high-tech alumina fiber manufacturing facility in B\u00e9k\u00e9scsaba, Hungary<\/strong>. This investment will strengthen production capacity within the European Union, helping to ensure a more secure and resilient supply chain for alumina fiber materials.<\/p><p id=\"ember465\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">The facility will begin with textile and yarn production, with discontinuous fiber capabilities planned for 2027. Beyond manufacturing, the project will support regional innovation through collaboration with local universities and research institutions.<\/p><p id=\"ember466\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">By expanding our manufacturing footprint into Europe, we aim to bring production closer to customers while supporting industries that rely on stable, long-term access to high-performance materials.<\/p><p><\/p><\/div><div><h3 id=\"ember467\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">What We\u2019ll Be Showcasing at JEC 2026<\/h3><p id=\"ember468\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">At<strong>Booth 5F114<\/strong>, we will present our portfolio of<strong>continuous<\/strong>and<strong>discontinuous alumina fiber products<\/strong>, designed for industries where conventional materials begin to reach their limits.<\/p><h3 id=\"ember469\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">Continuous Alumina Fiber Products<\/h3><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9fbf0da elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9fbf0da\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"423\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Braided-Sleeve-1024x676.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1735\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Braided-Sleeve-1024x676.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Braided-Sleeve-300x198.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Braided-Sleeve-768x507.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/Braided-Sleeve.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c881826 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c881826\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<header aria-label=\"Article header\"><\/header><div><div class=\"reader-image-block reader-image-block--resize\"><figure class=\"reader-image-block__figure\">Our continuous fiber solutions are used for reinforcement, textile integration, and applications requiring high-temperature durability. These include:<\/figure><\/div><ul><li>Fiber yarns and sewing threads<\/li><li>Braided ropes and braided sleeves<\/li><li>Woven tapes and woven fabrics<\/li><\/ul><p id=\"ember473\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">These materials combine<span class=\"white-space-pre\"> <\/span><strong>high tensile strength, strong modulus, thermal stability, and low weight<\/strong>, making them suitable for demanding composite and insulation systems.<\/p><h3 id=\"ember474\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">Discontinuous Alumina Fiber Product<\/h3><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a479ffb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"a479ffb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/50mm-Needled-Blanket-1024x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1739\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/50mm-Needled-Blanket-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/50mm-Needled-Blanket-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/50mm-Needled-Blanket-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/50mm-Needled-Blanket-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/50mm-Needled-Blanket.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7769023 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7769023\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<header aria-label=\"Article header\"><\/header><div><p id=\"ember476\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">We will also be showcasing our discontinuous alumina fiber solutions, including:<\/p><ul><li>Bulk alumina fiber<\/li><li>Needled alumina fiber blankets<\/li><li>Alumina fiber paper<\/li><\/ul><p id=\"ember478\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">These materials are commonly used for<strong>high-temperature insulation, thermal barriers, fire protection, and electrical insulation<\/strong>, particularly where flexibility and efficient heat containment are required.<\/p><h3 id=\"ember479\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">Supporting High-Performance Industries<\/h3><p id=\"ember480\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">As industries push toward<strong>greater energy efficiency, electrification, and lower emissions<\/strong>, the need for materials that can withstand higher operating temperatures continues to grow. Alumina fiber is increasingly relevant across multiple sectors, including:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Aerospace:<\/strong>Ceramic Matrix Composites (CMCs), thermal protection systems, and insulation in high-temperature zones<\/li><li><strong>Automotive &amp; Electric Vehicles:<\/strong>Battery insulation, fire-resistant barriers, exhaust shielding, and lightweight reinforcement<\/li><li><strong>Communications &amp; Electronics:<\/strong>Components requiring radio-wave permeability together with high modulus and thermal stability<\/li><li><strong>Energy &amp; Industrial Manufacturing:<\/strong>Furnace linings, kilns, reactors, and process insulation<\/li><li><strong>Advanced Composites:<\/strong>Reinforcement for<strong>CMC, MMC, and PMC systems<\/strong>operating under extreme conditions<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><h3 id=\"ember482\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">Why Alumina Fiber Matters<\/h3><p id=\"ember483\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">Alumina fiber materials offer a combination of properties that are increasingly difficult to achieve with traditional materials alone:<\/p><ul><li>High-temperature resistance<\/li><li>Lightweight performance<\/li><li>Corrosion resistance<\/li><li>Electrical insulation capability<\/li><li>Stability under repeated thermal cycling<\/li><\/ul><p id=\"ember485\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">These characteristics make alumina fiber a valuable material for next-generation composite structures and thermal management systems.<\/p><p><\/p><\/div><div><h3 id=\"ember486\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__heading-3\">Meet Us at JEC World 2026<\/h3><p id=\"ember487\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">JEC World is always a great opportunity for technical conversations and new connections. Our team will be at<strong>Booth 5F114<\/strong>to discuss applications, performance requirements, and how alumina fiber materials can be integrated into different manufacturing environments.<\/p><p id=\"ember488\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">If you\u2019re attending JEC World 2026, we\u2019d be glad to meet you and exchange ideas.<\/p><p id=\"ember489\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">We look forward to seeing you in Paris.<\/p><hr class=\"reader-divider-block__horizontal-rule\" \/><p id=\"ember490\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\"><strong>Booth Information<\/strong><\/p><p id=\"ember491\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\ud83d\udccd<strong>JEC World 2026<\/strong><\/p><p id=\"ember492\" class=\"ember-view reader-text-block__paragraph\">\ud83d\udccc<strong>Hall 5 \u2014 Booth F114<\/strong><\/p><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vulcan Shield Global will be exhibiting at JEC World 2026, the world\u2019s leading international composites exhibition. The annual event will take place in Paris, bringing together companies and professionals across advanced materials, composites manufacturing, aerospace, automotive, energy, and industrial sectors. You\u2019ll be able to find us atHall 5Booth F114, where we\u2019ll be sharing our latest [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1744,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"cybocfi_hide_featured_image":"","footnotes":"","_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1734","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-news"],"acf":[],"aioseo_notices":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/17